<% content_for('title', 'Partners, Sponsors, and Collaborators') %>
<h1 localizable>Partners, sponsors and collaborators</h1>

<p>
    Snap<em>!</em> is made possible by the generous support of our partners, sponsors, and collaborators.
    <strong>If you are interested in providing financial support, please consider <a href="/donate">donating to Snap<em>!</em></a>.
    </strong>
    <br/><br/>
    We are grateful to the following organizations for their support of Snap<em>!</em> and its community:
</p>

